3 data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"671\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"704\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>",
